The marks in this folder are from Simple Icons (https://simpleicons.org), version 16.35.0, released under CC0 1.0
Universal (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/): asana, atlassian, box, cloudflare, figma, github,
google, huggingface, imessage, instagram, linear, notion, sentry, stripe, supabase, todoist, vercel and x. Each file
keeps the icon's path alone.

